<<55>> Give me a writing exercise for a 6th grade student learning English. It should be an exercise on writing a report.
<<55>> You are going to write a report about a famous person. You will need to find out about their life and what they are famous for. Write your report below. Include the following information:
\begin{enumerate}
\item the person's full name
\item when and where they were born
\item what they are famous for
\item the person's early life
\item the person's achievements
\end{enumerate}
