<<90>> Give me a translation exercise for a student learning Spanish. It should have a subsection for answers. It should be an exercise on translating sentences.
<<90>> Translate the following sentences from Spanish to English.  
\begin{enumerate}
    \item La ciudad está llena de turistas. (The city is full of tourists.)
    \item La casa está llena de libros. (The house is full of books.)
    \item El bar está lleno de gente. (The bar is full of people.)
    \item El hotel está lleno. (The hotel is full.)
    \item El estadio está lleno. (The stadium is full.)
\end{enumerate}

\subsection*{Answers}
\begin{enumerate}
\item The city is full of tourists.
\item The house is full of books.
\item The bar is full of people.
\item The hotel is full.
\item The stadium is full.
\end{enumerate}
