<<109>> Give me a combination of an investigation exercise, a discussion exercise, a drawing exercise, a data collection exercise, and a photography exercise for a 3rd grade student learning science. It should be an exercise on plants. The exercise should contain some kind of a graphic component (illustration, diagram, table, etc).
