\item \( 300 - 249 \)
\item \( 200 - 137 \)
\item \( 400 - 273 \)
\end{enumerate}
<<207>> Give me a writing exercise for a student learning French. It should be an exercise on writing numbers in words. It should be a with Answer.
<<207>> Écrire les nombres suivants en toutes lettres.
\begin{enumerate}
    \item 1
    \item 6
    \item 15
    \item 24
    \item 41
    \item 61
    \item 72
    \item 85
    \item 93
    \item 100
\end{enumerate}

\subsection*{Answers}
\begin{enumerate}
    \item un
    \item six
    \item quinze
    \item vingt-quatre
    \item quarante et un
    \item soixante et un
    \item soixante-douze
    \item quatre-vingt-cinq
    \item quatre-vingt-treize
    \item cent
\end{enumerate}
<<208>> Give me a writing exercise for a student learning French. It should be an exercise on writing numbers in words. It should be a with Answer.
