<<241>> Give me a combination of a word problem and a fill in the blank exercise for a 5th grade student learning mathematics. It should be an exercise on time calculation. It should be a with Answer. It should have multiple steps.
<<241>> What time is it?

\begin{enumerate}[label=\alph*.]
\item It is 1 hour 30 minutes later than 5:00 p.m.
\item It is 2 hours 45 minutes later than 6:00 a.m.
\item It is 45 minutes later than 3:00 p.m.
\item It is 2 hours 15 minutes later than 4:00 p.m.
\end{enumerate}

\subsection*{Answers}
\begin{enumerate}[label=\alph*.]
\item 6:30 p.m.
\item 8:45 a.m.
\item 3:45 p.m.
\item 6:15 p.m.
\end{enumerate}
