<<388>> Give me a true or false exercise for a student learning Spanish. It should have a subsection for answers.
<<388>> Decide whether the following sentences are correct or incorrect.  
\begin{enumerate}
    \item Yo (estudiar) \_\_\_ español desde 1999. (I have been studying Spanish since 1999.)
    \item Ellos (comer) \_\_\_ en el restaurante de la esquina. (They have eaten at the restaurant on the corner.)
    \item ¿Usted (escuchar) \_\_\_ a Juan Luis Guerra? (Have you listened to Juan Luis Guerra?)
    \item Ella (hablar) \_\_\_ francés con su abuela. (She has spoken French with her grandmother.)
    \item Yo (escuchar) \_\_\_ a la banda de rock más grande de la historia. (I have listened to the greatest rock band in history.)
\end{enumerate}

\subsection*{Answers}
\begin{enumerate}
\item Correct
\item Incorrect
\item Correct
\item Correct
\item Correct
\end{enumerate}
