<<400>> Give me a word problem for a 6th grade student learning mathematics. It should have a subsection for answers.
<<400>> There are 4 students in a group. What is the fraction of the group that is made up of 1 student?

\subsection*{Answers}
The fraction of the group that is made up of 1 student is \(\frac{1}{4}\).
