<<413>> Give me a combination of a word problem exercise and a problem-solving exercise for a 5th grade student learning mathematics. It should have a subsection for answers.
<<413>> There are 16 children in a class. 5 are boys. How many girls are there?

\subsection*{Answers}
There are 11 girls in the class.
