<<481>> Give me a research exercise for a 5th grade student learning geography.
<<481>> Choose a seaside resort that you have not visited. Find out about it by:  
\begin{itemize}
\item using reference books, travel guides and holiday brochures  
\item asking people who have been there  
\item looking at advertisements on television, the Internet, in magazines and newspapers.
\end{itemize}  
Make notes about the resort's:  
\begin{itemize}
\item location  
\item climate  
\item attractions  
\item accommodation  
\item leisure activities  
\item problems.  
\end{itemize}  
