\item a place for people to work?
\item a place for people to rest and relax?
\item a place for people to learn and improve their skills?
\item a place for people to look after their health?
\item a place for people to buy food, clothes and other goods?
\item a place for people to eat and drink?
\item a place for people to enjoy themselves?
\item a place for people to store goods and equipment?
\item a place for people to look after animals?
