<<578>> Give me a combination of a group activity, an investigation, and a discussion exercise for a 6th grade student learning science. It should have a subsection for materials. It should be an exercise on habitats.
<<578>> \begin{itemize}
\item Work in a group of three.
\item Choose a habitat in your local area to investigate.
\item Discuss your habitat choice with your group.
\item Identify the plants and animals living in your chosen habitat.
\item Take notes and make drawings of the plants and animals you observe.
\item Discuss your findings with your group.
\item Share your results with the class.
\end{itemize}

\subsection*{Materials}
\begin{itemize}
\item Notebooks
\item Pencils
\item Pens
\item Erasers
\item Sharpener
\end{itemize}
