<<702>> What makes a good file name? What makes a bad file name? Write down some examples of each. Think about your own file names. How could you improve them? Write down some suggestions. Share your suggestions with a classmate. Do you agree with their suggestions? Write down any differences or similarities you notice. Write down one way you would improve the file names. Give your idea to a classmate to try. How did they do? Give them feedback. What did you learn from this exercise? Write down some key points. Share them with your teacher.
