<<739>> Give me a question exercise for a 4th grade student learning social studies. It should be an exercise on advertising.
<<739>> What are some of the methods used by advertisers? Why are they used? What is the purpose of advertising? Why do you think advertising is effective? How do you think people should behave when they see advertisements? Why do you think some advertisements are not allowed on television? Why do you think some products are not allowed to be advertised on television? How can people avoid the effects of advertisements? How can people choose not to buy products because of an advertisement? Why do you think people might not want to buy a product even though they have seen an advertisement? Why do you think some people do not like advertisements? How can people decide whether or not to buy a product? How can people make sure that they have all the facts before they make a decision? Why is it important to have all the facts? How can people be sure that advertisements are not misleading? What do you think would happen if advertisements were not allowed? Do you think this would be a good thing? Why? Do you think it would be a bad thing? Why? How do you think advertisements could be improved? How do you think people could be better informed about advertisements? How do you think people could be protected from misleading advertisements? How do you think people could be protected from advertisements that try to persuade them to buy things they do not need? What do you think would happen if people did not buy things they do not need? Do you think this would be a good thing? Why? Do you think it would be a bad thing? Why? Do you think it is wrong to try to persuade people to buy things they do not need? Why? How do you think people could be better protected from this? How do you think people could be better informed about the products that are available? How do you think people could be better protected from advertisements that try to persuade them to buy things that are not good for them? What do you think would happen if people did not buy things that are not good for them? 